{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/606116-setting-building-problem","id":606116,"title":"Setting Building Problem","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-28T18:22:21-07:00","id":606116,"title":"Setting Building Problem","content":"I am about to run a Classic WoD setting game using nWoD rules. Basic premise to the game is the players are all 16-25 year old college students enrolled in a 'practical studies' course where over the course of the year they are tasked to refurbish, remodel, and restore a newly acquired property for college use. I have a variety of ideas for the actual game, and the players will all start as mortals only finding out in game what game theme they might end up in.<br /> My problem: Where to place this college? Original city or one that actually exists? Where in America (or U.K.) if custom. Which one if just using a college or city that exists in life?<br /> I keep running into a block trying to decide.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/494-exalted-viovode","name":"Exalted Viovode","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T22:35:47-07:00","id":606348,"title":"","content":"Miskatonic University. &gt;:3<br /> <br /> But, really, I have no idea what to suggest there, because it really depends on what -you- as the GM feel comfortable with, and might have knowledge (or lots of reading material) about. Are you good at winging it and making things up on the fly? Or do you feel more at ease with having a RL place you can gather and prepare a lot of info about?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T22:53:12-07:00","id":606370,"title":"","content":"I can do either honestly. When theres cannon/ real material I tend to lock in on it, when I create my own settings they tend to be ill defined. So both have issues. Hence my difficulty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/494-exalted-viovode","name":"Exalted Viovode","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T03:55:48-07:00","id":606464,"title":"","content":"So mix things up. Pick a real place but shuffle it with your own creations, be it specific buildings, people, lore or events. Use the RL data to enhance your own creations, or spice up what really exists with your ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T12:10:40-07:00","id":606907,"title":"","content":"Real World Thaddeus Stevens it is a &quot;technical school&quot; that specializes in doing just that sort of practical studies. One of the dorms is an old hospital, there is an American Revolutionary War hospital on the grounds, the county morgue is across the street, the county prison down a block, and just to freak out anyone who has read IT the park across from the campus has a water tower. <br /> Thaddeus Stevens school can be found in Lancaster Pa a look at Google maps and the web site for the school should help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T12:30:47-07:00","id":606941,"title":"","content":"You could also borrow a fictional university from a game sourcebook. I mentioned several, including <b>World Of Darkness</b> examples, in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/359205-university-as-a-setting-for-a-chronicle\">this thread</a> about setting a game in and around a university.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T13:56:14-07:00","id":607070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exalted Viovode</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/606116-setting-building-problem?p=606370#post606370\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can do either honestly. When theres cannon/ real material I tend to lock in on it, when I create my own settings they tend to be ill defined. So both have issues. Hence my difficulty.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my VtM game, I took a real world place, changed the name, altered parts of the history and made it my own. It's a nice middle ground between detailed real world place and fantasy build-your-own. Figure out the country and region you want to place the story. Look for a suitable candidate for your needs. Then add/remove/rewrite what you want until the city/town/state feels less like Miami, Florida and more like Mialami, Florida (sorry, not feeling original today).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}